---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Causewave Innovations LLP"
  description="Privacy Policy for Causewave Innovations LLP"
  ogTitle="Privacy Policy | Causewave"
  ogDescription="Privacy Policy for Causewave Innovations LLP"
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy"
  activePage=""
>
  <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-4">
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> May 29, 2026</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-6">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect information you provide directly to us, such as when you fill out our contact form, including your name, email address, phone number, company name, and project details.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-6">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to respond to your inquiries, provide our services, and communicate with you about your projects.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-6">3. Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information with trusted service providers who assist us in operating our business.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-6">4. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We implement appropriate security measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-6">5. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal information. To exercise these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:innovate@causewave.in" class="text-sky-600 hover:underline">innovate@causewave.in</a>.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-6">6. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
      <p>Causewave Innovations LLP<br>Ahmedabad, Gujarat, India<br>Email: <a href="mailto:innovate@causewave.in" class="text-sky-600 hover:underline">innovate@causewave.in</a><br>Phone: +91 76005 96053</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>